{"type":"message","id":"9cba306c","parentId":"3dd0e53b","timestamp":"2026-04-09T19:48:40.538Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"839\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"495506013\",\n  \"sender\": \"Matteo Cicalese\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-04-09 19:48 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"Matteo Cicalese (495506013)\",\n  \"id\": \"495506013\",\n  \"name\": \"Matteo Cicalese\",\n  \"username\": \"CicaMatt\"\n}\n```\n\nmodify the slm-expert-backup skill so that it is identical to the slm-dermatology, except for the fact that in this skill the SLM serves as a nephrology, cardiology and hypertension expert, and you call \"/chat\" directly without invoking load-adapter. the endpoint is still \"http://looporchestra.sytes.net:8007/docs#\""}],"timestamp":1775764120535}}
